cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework, please cite the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "Actor-level explanations of dyadic event forecasts: an open-source framework with stability auditing"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework for binary dyad-month political event prediction with
  exact additive source- and target-actor explanations and a stability audit.
  The confirmatory evaluation uses a pre-registered unit-fresh 20% dyad holdout.
authors:
  - name: "LAGS-1 authors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - dyadic event forecasting
  - ICEWS
  - explainability
  - stability audit
  - calibration
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/Quietpeng/lags1-dyad-explanations"
